-- FOLDED-TARGET-REVERT-1 (2026-10-26, charter pillar: autonomy; follows ISSUE-HYGIENE-1 to -6). Settles the records of PR 4620 (code task ct_im1000417), which this change reverts in the repository.
--
-- WHAT HAPPENED (read 2026-10-26 from live qnfo-audit, the repository and the deploy-gate run log)
--   Issue 1000417 (ROADMAP-1: QNFO.OPS #1, "Auto-attach doer, SLA and next action to untriaged open issues") was dispatched straight into code_tasks as ct_im1000417 (the RED-DRAIN-1 dispatch
--   inserts ct_im<issue> rows without passing enqueue(), the only place FOLDED-TARGET-REDIRECT-1 and RETIRED-TARGET-1 run). Its path was qnfo-backlog-exec/worker.js. That directory carries a
--   FOLDED file: the canonical deploy skips it and its code runs as the member backlogMod inside qnfo-lifecycle/worker.js, which qnfo-lifecycle/backlog-fold.test.mjs holds line-identical.
--   The merge runner merged PR 4620 (a2b4cb71) at 14:06Z; the next deploy-gate run on main went red (run 40336847075, SUITE-RUNNER-1: backlog-fold.test.mjs), ci-watchdog filed GitHub issue 4624,
--   and ct_im1000417 has waited in merge_state 'deploying' since, for a deploy that cannot happen. The change was also empty: its INSERT OR IGNORE INTO issue_triage inserts nothing because
--   334 of 334 open agent_issues hold an issue_triage row (trigger agent_issues_autotriage2_ins), and the metric it names, v_issues_no_next_action (93 rows), reads remediation_contracts,
--   code-task lines, work claims and human_actions, not issue_triage. The roadmap text asked for INSERT OR REPLACE, which would have overwritten the triage state, close evidence and reopen
--   counts of every open issue.
--
-- WHAT THIS FILE DOES (rows only; the repository revert is in the same pull request)
--   1. closes issue 1000417 as moot through the ISSUE-HYGIENE-1 mechanism (issue_fold_ledger keeps the before-state; the contract leaves the closing path; the evidence goes into issue_triage);
--   2. marks ct_im1000417 superseded (it waited for a deploy of a reverted change) and roadmap_proposals 1 rejected with the reason, so the managers do not re-file it as built;
--   3. files FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1 for qnfo-code-orchestrator: the read step judges the merge scope of a directly inserted row (MERGE-SCOPE-AT-READ-1) but not its FOLDED or RETIRED target.
--   No DELETE, no DROP, no trigger is added.
--
-- APPLY-BY: ci
-- DB: qnfo-audit
-- Rollback: UPDATE issue_triage SET triage_state = (SELECT f.triage_state FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = issue_triage.issue_id AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1), close_evidence = (SELECT f.triage_close_evidence FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = issue_triage.issue_id AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1), reopened_count = (SELECT f.triage_reopened_count FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = issue_triage.issue_id AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1), triaged_at = (SELECT f.triage_triaged_at FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = issue_triage.issue_id AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1) WHERE issue_id IN (SELECT issue_id FROM issue_fold_ledger WHERE rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND applied = 1); UPDATE agent_issues SET status = 'open', close_channel = (SELECT f.agent_close_channel FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = agent_issues.id AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1), updated_at = CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000 WHERE id IN (SELECT issue_id FROM issue_fold_ledger WHERE rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND applied = 1) AND status = 'closed' AND close_channel = 'workflow:ISSUE-HYGIENE-1 session-folded-revert-2026-10-26'; UPDATE remediation_contracts SET status = (SELECT f.contract_status FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.contract_class = remediation_contracts.class AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1), last_verdict = (SELECT f.contract_last_verdict FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.contract_class = remediation_contracts.class AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.applied = 1 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1) WHERE class IN (SELECT contract_class FROM issue_fold_ledger WHERE rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND applied = 1 AND contract_class IS NOT NULL) AND last_verdict LIKE 'superseded:closure-superseded%'; UPDATE code_tasks SET merge_state = 'deploying', merge_note = 'waiting on canonical deploy' WHERE id = 'ct_im1000417' AND merge_state = 'superseded' AND merge_note LIKE 'FOLDED-TARGET-REVERT-1:%'; UPDATE roadmap_proposals SET status = 'building', outcome = 'queued' WHERE id = 1 AND status = 'rejected' AND outcome LIKE 'reverted:%'; UPDATE issue_triage SET triage_state = 'closed', triaged_at = datetime('now'), close_evidence = 'rollback of FOLDED-TARGET-REVERT-1: the follow-up is withdrawn with the revert record' WHERE issue_id IN (SELECT id FROM agent_issues WHERE title LIKE 'FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1:%' AND status = 'open'); UPDATE agent_issues SET status = 'closed', close_channel = 'rollback:FOLDED-TARGET-REVERT-1', updated_at = CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000 WHERE title LIKE 'FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1:%' AND status = 'open'

-- 1. The ledger row: the before-state and the evidence
INSERT INTO issue_fold_ledger (issue_id, rule, successor_id, evidence, agent_status, agent_updated_at, agent_close_channel, triage_state, triage_close_evidence, triage_reopened_count, triage_triaged_at, contract_class, contract_status, contract_last_verdict, contract_last_attempt_at) SELECT m.id, 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26', v.succ, v.ev || ' ISSUE-HYGIENE-1 ' || strftime('%Y-%m-%d', 'now'), m.status, m.updated_at, m.close_channel, t.triage_state, t.close_evidence, t.reopened_count, t.triaged_at, c.class, c.status, c.last_verdict, c.last_attempt_at FROM (SELECT 1000417 AS id, 'moot: the change cannot run and changes nothing. qnfo-backlog-exec is FOLDED into qnfo-lifecycle (its directory carries FOLDED, the canonical deploy skips it, the live code is the member backlogMod in qnfo-lifecycle/worker.js), so PR 4620 reached no runtime and turned the full suite red (qnfo-lifecycle/backlog-fold.test.mjs, deploy-gate run 40336847075); it is reverted. Its INSERT OR IGNORE inserts nothing: 334 of 334 open issues hold an issue_triage row, and v_issues_no_next_action (93 rows) reads contracts, code-task lines, claims and cards, not issue_triage.' AS ev, NULL AS succ) v JOIN agent_issues m ON m.id = v.id JOIN issue_triage t ON t.issue_id = m.id LEFT JOIN remediation_contracts c ON c.class = 'issue-' || m.id WHERE m.status = 'open' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = m.id AND f.applied = 0);

-- 2. Settle the contract, name the channel, close through the triage row, mark the ledger
UPDATE remediation_contracts SET status = 'superseded', last_verdict = 'superseded:closure-superseded (ISSUE-HYGIENE-1)', last_attempt_at = datetime('now') WHERE class IN (SELECT f.contract_class FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.applied = 0 AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND f.contract_class IS NOT NULL) AND status IN ('monitoring', 'escalated', 'active', 'holding', 'needs-machine-probe', 'probe-review-refused');
UPDATE agent_issues SET close_channel = 'workflow:ISSUE-HYGIENE-1 ' || (SELECT f.rule FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = agent_issues.id AND f.applied = 0 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1) WHERE status = 'open' AND id IN (SELECT issue_id FROM issue_fold_ledger WHERE applied = 0 AND rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26');
UPDATE issue_triage SET triage_state = 'closed', triaged_at = datetime('now'), close_evidence = (SELECT f.evidence FROM issue_fold_ledger f WHERE f.issue_id = issue_triage.issue_id AND f.applied = 0 ORDER BY f.id DESC LIMIT 1) WHERE issue_id IN (SELECT f.issue_id FROM issue_fold_ledger f JOIN agent_issues a ON a.id = f.issue_id WHERE f.applied = 0 AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND a.status = 'open');
UPDATE agent_issues SET status = 'closed', updated_at = CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000 WHERE status = 'open' AND id IN (SELECT f.issue_id FROM issue_fold_ledger f JOIN issue_triage t ON t.issue_id = f.issue_id WHERE f.applied = 0 AND f.rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND t.triage_state = 'closed' AND t.close_evidence = f.evidence);
UPDATE issue_fold_ledger SET applied = 1, applied_at = datetime('now') WHERE applied = 0 AND rule = 'session-folded-revert-2026-10-26' AND (SELECT a.status FROM agent_issues a WHERE a.id = issue_fold_ledger.issue_id) <> 'open';

-- 3. The code task waited for a deploy of a reverted change; the roadmap row is not built
UPDATE code_tasks SET merge_state = 'superseded', merge_note = 'FOLDED-TARGET-REVERT-1: PR 4620 edited qnfo-backlog-exec (FOLDED into qnfo-lifecycle; never deployed) and is reverted; issue 1000417 is closed as moot' WHERE id = 'ct_im1000417' AND merge_state = 'deploying';
UPDATE roadmap_proposals SET status = 'rejected', outcome = 'reverted: the edit targeted a FOLDED directory and inserted no row (see agent_issues 1000417 close_evidence)', updated_at = strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now') WHERE id = 1 AND task_id = 'ct_im1000417' AND status = 'building';

-- 4. The follow-up that stops the next one, with its doer and its closing probe
INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT 'FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1: a code task written straight into code_tasks is not redirected from a FOLDED directory, so its change never ships and the full suite goes red',
  'Charter pillar: autonomy. Read 2026-10-26: ct_im1000417 (RED-DRAIN-1 dispatch) edited qnfo-backlog-exec/worker.js. enqueue() runs foldedHost (FOLDED-TARGET-REDIRECT-1) and retiredTarget (RETIRED-TARGET-1) on the path; a row inserted straight into code_tasks never passes enqueue(), and the read step judges only mergeScopeWhy (MERGE-SCOPE-AT-READ-1). The merge runner merged PR 4620, the canonical deploy skips FOLDED directories, qnfo-lifecycle/backlog-fold.test.mjs (the member is line-identical to its host) failed on main (deploy-gate run 40336847075, GitHub issue 4624) and the task waited in merge_state deploying for a deploy that cannot happen.' || char(10) ||
  'Doer: qnfo-code-orchestrator. In the read step, directly after the mergeScopeWhy refusal (anchor below), call foldedHost(env, task.repo, task.path); when it returns a host, write the host path to code_tasks.path and to task.path, audit code-task.intake-redirect as enqueue() does, and continue; then call retiredTarget and end the task needs_human with its message when it refuses. Both helpers compare the raw repo slug with qnfo-workers; pass repoSlug(task.repo). Add cases to qnfo-code-orchestrator/folded-redirect.test.mjs (a direct row on a FOLDED member is redirected to its host and a RETIRED path ends needs_human with no model call). Bump VERSION as a patch above main and keep deployed-current.worker.js identical.' || char(10) ||
  'Definition of done: the read step carries the redirect (the code-probe below passes) and the suite cases are in the repository.' || char(10) ||
  'code-task: repo=qnfo-workers path=qnfo-code-orchestrator/worker.js' || char(10) ||
  'code-anchor: const scopeWhy = mergeScopeWhy(task.repo, task.path);' || char(10) ||
  'code-probe: {"paths": ["qnfo-code-orchestrator/worker.js"], "contains": "FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1"}',
  'session', 'reliability', 'high', 'open',
  CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,
  CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM agent_issues WHERE title LIKE 'FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1:%' AND status = 'open');

INSERT INTO decision_log (actor, assumption, action, evidence, outcome, blast_radius, rollback_path, capability_gain, predicted_outcome, reach_gain, surfaces_tested)
SELECT 'session_015kWmGuAq2fNuvzu4MrD7x3',
