  'read 2026-10-26: deploy-gate run 40336847075 red at SUITE-RUNNER-1 (backlog-fold.test.mjs, 15 checks, one failing: guest lines absent from qnfo-lifecycle); node qnfo-lifecycle/backlog-fold.test.mjs passes 15 of 15 on the reverted tree; 334 of 334 open agent_issues hold an issue_triage row; v_issues_no_next_action does not read issue_triage; code_tasks ct_im1000417 created 13:36:47Z by direct insert, merged 14:06:27Z, merge_state deploying',
