  'rows in issue_fold_ledger, issue_triage, agent_issues, code_tasks, roadmap_proposals (one each) and one new agent_issues row; a revert of 8 lines in a FOLDED directory. No secret, no binding, no live worker changes',
  'run the Rollback line of this file and re-apply PR 4620 only after the fold host carries the same lines',
  'the full suite is green on main again and the code loop stops targeting folded directories once FOLDED-TARGET-AT-READ-1 ships',
